-ad64-7017-9794-7fc29ed01184","description":"MiG","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad64-7c15-83f0-db46a7a9d12b","description":"Ilyushin Il-86","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad64-76ac-9881-fc3b238eac57","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Who is the Greek equivalent of the Roman god Mars?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Ares was associated with the violence and bloodshed of battle, while the Romans\u2019 Mars also became a major protector of the state and agriculture.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad64-747a-8231-506dc6dfdc94","description":"Ares","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad64-7c07-9109-cd248a91f806","description":"Athena","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad64-7ed9-966d-8eab95805c5e","description":"Hephaestus","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad64-79dd-b667-e9321d1d97bd","description":"Zeus","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad64-73a1-ad7c-c7bea810403e","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"What is the name of the store where customers can build and customize their own stuffed animals?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"At Build-A-Bear, customers can help stuff their plush toy and choose its clothes and accessories.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad64-79ba-a869-14ec29e6149e","description":"Build-A-Bear","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad64-7ac9-af71-ee96e56ea978","description":"Teddy Bear Emporium","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad64-7f32-849a-bad2067a9e3d","description":"Toy Workshop","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad64-7bd6-9d01-d35e4c54556f","description":"Plush Pals","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad64-7dca-ae8d-008baa653b2c","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which of these Latin phrases means \'A beard doesn\'t make one a philosopher\'?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Barba non facit philosophum draws on the traditional image of ancient philosophers as bearded men, while warning that appearance alo