ith a romantic partner?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Ghosting is especially associated with dating and messaging, where someone may end a connection simply by stopping replies.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad64-7890-8f4a-4a9e3f31cc67","description":"Ghosting","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad64-7d83-a301-b58581ac2684","description":"Dropping","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad64-766e-8698-cddf8ed10a9d","description":"Vanishing","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad64-7d93-b9ff-3300eed01e94","description":"Negging","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad64-7164-81e7-89fc7a892aa4","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which marketing slogan would you associate with Sprite?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"\u201cObey your thirst\u201d became Sprite\u2019s signature tagline, used in campaigns featuring artists and athletes.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad64-7bdc-b35b-82201a5b0aa1","description":"Obey your thirst","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad64-727d-82e1-d9e29e77c019","description":"Twist the cap to refreshment","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad64-7686-af1d-63749f43f838","description":"It\'s the real thing","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad64-7634-8714-0a6a90d11464","description":"Open Happiness","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad64-7388-833d-5d90b3a5e7db","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which beer brand is associated with the marketing slogan \'King of Beers\'?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Budweiser introduced its Clydesdale team in 1933 to celebrate the end of Prohibition.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad64-7a5b-9151-6993da3af314","description":"Budweiser","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad64-77d2-8bed-a4f1f061653c","description":"Guinness","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad64-74ce-b87f-7def2cc72705","description":"Stella Artois","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad64-752c-94fc-80f52310c93d","description":"Corona","c